  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2015 - 2026 Chevy Colorado/Gmc Canyon Crew Cab models with 4 full-size doors\nFeatures\nVehicle Fitment: Designed to fit 2015–2026 Chevy Colorado and GMC Canyon Crew Cab models with four full-size doors. Please double-check compatibility with your specific vehicle configuration before purchasing.\nPractical 3.5-Inch Drop Design: Tailored for easy entry and exit, these drop-down side steps are perfect for both everyday driving and off-road adventures. The textured plastic step pads offer a secure, anti-slip surface for safer footing in all conditions.\nCorrosion-Resistant Finish: Built to withstand the elements, the nerf bars are coated in a black powder finish that resists rust and corrosion, helping maintain a sleek appearance and long-term durability.\nStrong and Reliable Build: Constructed from tough carbon steel with reinforced welds at key connection points, these running boards can handle up to 450 pounds, offering both strength and stability.\nQuick, Tool-Free Installation: Installing the side steps is a breeze with included step-by-step instructions. No need for specialized tools—just use what’s in the box: two nerf bars, mounting hardware, and eight brackets (four per side) for enhanced support compared to traditional 3-bracket setups.\nProfessional installation recommended",
